356
00:29:33,689 --> 00:29:35,441
Benar. Ya.

357
00:29:36,025 --> 00:29:39,320
Astaga. Aku terlalu banyak minum.

358
00:29:40,905 --> 00:29:43,866
Seharusnya aku tak mabuk,
Kyeong-do baru berhenti minum.

359
00:29:43,949 --> 00:29:45,367
