369
00:30:07,097 --> 00:30:10,059
Entahlah. Itu karena dia mabuk.

370
00:30:14,605 --> 00:30:15,523
Manajer Kim.

371
00:30:18,359 --> 00:30:19,944
Ada yang tertinggal?

372
00:30:20,694 --> 00:30:22,112
Tidak, bukan itu.

373
00:30:23,614 --> 00:30:24,949
Soal ucapanmu tadi.

374
00:30:26,700 --> 00:30:30,162
Aku cuma asal bicara karena mabuk. Oke?

375
00:30:30,246 --> 00:30:31,372
