394
00:33:10,948 --> 00:33:12,157
TIGA TAHUN LALU

395
00:33:12,241 --> 00:33:13,283
Aku tak setinggi itu.

396
00:33:13,367 --> 00:33:15,327
Proporsi tubuhmu bagus.

397
00:33:16,578 --> 00:33:19,957
Boleh kami memotretmu dulu
