418
00:35:14,696 --> 00:35:15,656
Apa ini?

419
00:35:30,963 --> 00:35:31,922
Terima kasih.

420
00:35:47,646 --> 00:35:49,022
Kau mau turun?

421
00:35:50,607 --> 00:35:51,817
Ini eksklusif.

422
00:35:53,443 --> 00:35:56,321
Tim Hiburan Dongwoon pandai bekerja.

423
00:35:56,822 --> 00:35:58,824
Asisten manajernya
membuat artikel sendiri.

424
00:36:01,118 --> 00:36:05,539
Kak Han-kyeong.
Aku sudah lelah, jangan mengomel.

425
00:36:08,000 --> 00:36:09,293
Aku berterima kasih.

426
00:36:17,634 --> 00:36:18,760
Kau…

427
00:36:20,220 --> 00:36:21,889
